&lt;p&gt;💰Base salary £170k - £225k + Equity +&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
