&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actively fostering a high bar for engineering excellence within your teams. You’re accountable for the technical outcomes your teams deliver alongside individual engineer performance and growth, so holding a high bar (and clearly articulating your expectations) is key.&lt;/li&gt;
