&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner with senior engineers in your area to drive technical initiatives that raise the bar for our engineering practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead on communication with stakeholders from other teams, creating focus space for engineers to do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the wider engineering organisation to contribute to company-wide best managerial and technical practices and standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
