&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;While this is not a role which requires hands-on-coding, we are looking for an experienced manager who has a strong technical and delivery background and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;has worked as a software engineer in previous roles.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
