&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰 £115,000 - £150,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Machine Learning Search Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently embarking on one of our two top strategic priorities to make Money work for Everyone: building the Monzo Co-pilot. We are becoming an intelligent, proactive ally that handles the complexity of users financial life. We aren&#39;t just selling financial products; we are building a truly smart agent that understands users, anticipates their needs, and helps people reach their financial goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ML Search team brings together Backend, Product, Machine Learning Scientists and Data Scientists. As a Lead Machine Learning Scientist, you’ll build and ship models that help customers search for and find answers about their financial lives. You&#39;ll make it effortless for them to find the right products at the exact moment they need them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether it’s surfacing the right savings product at the perfect moment, helping customers manage their spending, or simplifying financial planning, our work makes banking smarter, more intuitive, and truly customer-first.&lt;/p&gt;
