&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First stage - Meet with our Collective Product Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second stage - Meet with our Engineering and Finance leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Third stage - Product full loop&lt;/li&gt;
