&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👋 Hey there! We&#39;re Monzo, the bank that&#39;s making money work for everyone.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re all about waving goodbye to old-school banking and creating magical moments for our customers. This is an exciting time to join us as we continue to grow, and in this role as a Senior Investigator you&#39;ll play a key part in supporting our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
