&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory video call with a member of the Monzo Recruitment team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An initial video call with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A series of role specific, behavioural &amp;amp; leadership principles interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
