&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍London or Remote (UK) | 💰Competitive base salary and stock options |&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help build the future of customer operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone. Operations is at the heart of that mission. It’s where we help millions of customers, solve complex problems and keep Monzo safe. Now, we’re redesigning how customer operations work by bringing together intelligent automation, human expertise and world-class technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Technical Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead complex company wide programmes driven by the Operations collective. You’ll turn ambitious ideas into clear plans, bring a large and varied group of partners with you and help teams deliver lasting change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is about more than keeping work on track. You’ll shape how we work across the collective, influence domain and collective leaders across Monzo, connect technical delivery to operational outcomes and make sure change works for the people who use it every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead programmes that cut through all operational domains at Monzo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead high-impact programmes from strategy through to measurable outcomes. These may cover AI-powered customer support, tools that help our Customer Operations teams, or the platforms and processes behind millions of operational decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships at every level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with a large and varied group of partners. This could include frontline Operations teams, subject matter experts, product and engineering teams, risk and compliance partners, senior leaders and executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive change, not just delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help the whole collective adopt new ways of working. You’ll understand how changes affect people, processes and technology, then build that into the programme from the start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end planning and execution of major product or platform programs that cross multiple teams and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross-collective programmes:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define programme roadmaps and milestones, set priorities, manage trade-offs, identify and manage the critical path and risks, ensure alignment with the business goals and ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and communicate with multiple stakeholders, both technical and non-technical across the business to ensure alignment and speed of delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage dependencies, timeline and the sequencing of delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive effective decision making to remove blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational effectiveness across your collective/area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience managing complex technology programmes or products from inception to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an exceptional communicator who can create clarity for technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working in a global business with a presence in multiple markets and want to be part of scaling this further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work effectively with a diverse range of people and working styles to get stuff done, and are able to thoughtfully and constructively challenge and influence the people you work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can make complex work easy to understand without losing the important detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how functionality comes together (across products and platforms) to deliver value for users, and can proactively identify and mitigate delivery risks, and can propose and drive a technical solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable personally diving deep into the data to make good decisions in complex situations where there’s often no “right answer”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can influence across teams even when you don’t manage them directly and can influence senior leaders, resolve disagreement and build alignment without relying on authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve driven organisation-wide change and can show how you supported adoption, not only delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to match every point. If you’re excited by the role and believe you could have an impact, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes this role different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most companies are adding AI to existing support processes. We’re redesigning the operating model itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help shape how intelligent automation and human expertise work together in a highly regulated environment. The programmes you lead will affect how teams across Operations work and how millions of customers get help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the scope to influence strategy, the responsibility to turn it into action and the chance to build ways of working that scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations &amp;amp; Flexible Working :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value meeting in person but there’s no pressure to come into the office, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️. Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency. 🕒✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter Call (30 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet our Engineering Leadership Recruiter to discuss your experience and learn more about Monzo. They&#39;ll be your partner and guide throughout the interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial Call (45 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet with one of our engineering leaders. They&#39;ll ask you about your previous experience, in particular program execution and technical leadership. They’ll also make time to tell you about Monzo and answer your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop Stage (3 hours)&lt;/strong&gt; The Loop stage consists of 3 x 60 min interviews that take place over 1-2 days (depending on your availability).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All things going well, you&#39;ll have completed the hiring process 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You’ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team throughout the process. If you’d like to ask a question sooner, email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:tech-hiring@monzo.com&quot;&gt;tech-hiring@monzo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Base salary range for this role is dependent on experience + equity + stock options &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍Dublin, Ireland | 💰&lt;strong&gt;€92,000 - €116,000, Incentive Awards tied to your performance ➕ benefits&lt;/strong&gt;|&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U62l09nB0M4&quot;&gt; Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ Our Risk team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Operational, Technology and Information Security Risk Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; in the second line of defence to provide independent oversight, challenge and advisory support on the effectiveness of our operational, technology, resilience and information security risk management practices across the EU.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a key member of the second line risk management team and work closely with senior stakeholders across first line technology, information security and operational resilience, to ensure risks are proactively identified, assessed, monitored, and managed in line with Monzo&#39;s risk management framework and appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a proactive and strategic mindset, strong technology risk management expertise, and a deep understanding of operational resilience and digital banking operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Director of Operational Risk, Monzo Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role you are applying for is a Controlled Function within the meaning of the Central Bank Reform Act, 2010. For this role, appointment will be conditional on Monzo being fully satisfied that the appointee meets the requirements as set out in the Fitness and Probity Standards issued by the Central Bank of Ireland. As a CF, the role holder will be subject to Conduct Standards under the Central Bank of Ireland Individual Accountability Framework (IAF) and will be required to take reasonable steps to ensure that the relevant conduct standards are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as the second line subject matter expert for operational risk, technology (ICT and security risk (including cyber)), and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing and challenging the design and effectiveness of controls over key technology systems, digital infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing effective oversight and challenge of first line risk and control self-assessments (RCSA), incident management and reporting, issue remediation and risk mitigation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing second line input into our technology and security strategies and business continuity planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the ongoing development and maintenance of our Operational Risk Management Framework (ORMF), policies, standards and associated ICT,&amp;nbsp; Security and Resilience policies and risk appetite metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinating second line assurance reviews and risk deep dives into critical operational and technology areas, providing actionable recommendations and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing ongoing compliance with&amp;nbsp; the digital operational resilience act (DORA) in the EU and ensuring alignment&amp;nbsp; with applicable local regulatory standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing operational and technology risk reports and providing updates to relevant governance forums, including risk committees and senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 8+ years’ experience in operational risk, technology risk or related roles in financial services, ideally within a digital or challenger bank, or a pan-European firm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep knowledge of risk management practices, regulatory expectations, and industry standards related to operational risk, technology and operational resilience. (e.g. EBA Guidelines on ICT &amp;amp; Security Risk Management, DORA, Central Bank of Ireland Guidance on Operational Resilience, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), Payment Service Directive (PSD2/PSD3)).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of digital banking technology, including cloud computing, cybersecurity, fintech integrations and data management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in evaluating and challenging risk and control environments, particularly in high-growth or fast-changing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an ambitious risk professional ready to leave the constraints of legacy firms behind. This role places you at the cutting edge of technology and operational risk, challenging you to define the governance needed for our next-generation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong analytical, problem-solving and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence senior leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven ability to navigate complex stakeholder landscapes such as working with regulators/managing regulatory engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything that&#39;s listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 A salary range of €92,000 - €116,000&amp;nbsp;➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role will have a hybrid working model, based in our Dublin office 2 - 3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏝 Annual Leave - 34 days including public holidays (24 holiday days + 10 public holidays)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚€1,200 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥Private healthcare scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Pension scheme: the minimum contribution is 4% and Monzo matches any additional contributions that you make up to a maximum of 6%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💛Wellbeing benefits: financial education, women’s and men’s health support, mental health benefits, including coaching and counselling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory call with a member of the Monzo Recruitment team&lt;/li&gt;
