&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Tech Hiring team ⭐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a high performing tech hiring team, hiring for Engineering, Product, Data and Design. We partner with teams across the business to hire exceptional people into a huge variety of roles, from individual contributors through to senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our team continues to grow, we&#39;re looking for a Player Coach to lead a small squad of Recruiters while remaining hands-on with hiring. This is a leadership role for someone who loves developing people just as much as they love finding great talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll lead hiring strategy for your tech business area&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the trusted hiring partner for Execs and senior stakeholders, helping shape hiring plans, organisational design and hiring strategy. You&#39;ll work closely with Workforce Planning and Business Hiring leadership to understand upcoming demand and ensure your team is focused on the highest-impact hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll lead and coach a team of Recruiters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll manage, coach and develop a team of Recruiters, creating an environment where people can do their best work. You&#39;ll support them through complex hiring challenges, provide thoughtful feedback, help them grow their careers and ensure they&#39;re delivering consistently excellent hiring outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll balance day-to-day coaching with making decisions about priorities, workload and resource allocation across your team as business needs evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll stay hands-on with hiring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside leading your team, you&#39;ll personally manage a requisition load. You&#39;ll partner with Hiring Managers to design effective assessment processes, challenge thinking where needed and deliver exceptional candidate experiences from first conversation through to offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be just as comfortable recruiting senior leaders as you are hiring individual contributors, and you&#39;ll continue to lead by example through your own hiring delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll raise the bar on hiring quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be passionate about improving how we hire. You&#39;ll use data, market insights and candidate feedback to identify opportunities, refine our processes and influence hiring decisions. You&#39;ll help embed inclusive hiring practices across your team and continually look for ways to improve quality, efficiency and candidate experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be an expert in your market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll proactively source exceptional talent, understand competitor activity and share market insights with Hiring Managers and your team. You&#39;ll help shape hiring strategies that allow us to attract diverse, high-quality candidates in competitive markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll contribute to the growth of the Tech Hiring team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with other Hiring Leaders to share best practice, solve cross-functional hiring challenges and help shape how our team evolves as Monzo continues to grow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built significant experience recruiting in-house, within tech functions (e.g. Product, Engineering etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve managed or coached Recruiters and enjoy helping others develop and succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re excited by a player-coach role that combines people leadership with hands-on recruitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable partnering with senior stakeholders, including VPs and executives, influencing hiring strategy and challenging constructively where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve recruited across a range of levels, from mid-level hires through to Senior Manager and Director roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an excellent sourcer and know how to attract outstanding passive talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use data and market insights to influence hiring decisions and improve recruitment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re passionate about inclusive hiring and creating exceptional candidate experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trusted relationships quickly and thrive in fast-moving, collaborative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve managed hiring teams across multiple locations or hybrid/remote environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve recruited tech roles within a high-growth startup or scale-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve partnered closely with workforce planning or capacity planning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve helped build or improve recruitment processes at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Competitive Salary ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
