&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tax team⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Monzo, a leading UK bank that is innovating the financial sector by offering an array of diverse and differentiated banking services. As a Transfer Pricing Manager within the Group Tax squad, you will report directly to the International Tax &amp;amp; Transfer Pricing Lead, taking end-to-end ownership of Monzo’s transfer pricing operations, policies, and documentation.&lt;br&gt;This role is ideal for a qualified accountant or tax advisor looking to make a significant impact in a fast-paced fintech environment. We welcome candidates making their first move out of practice, as well as those with previous in-house experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Leading the preparation, maintenance, and ongoing updates of Master Files, Local Files, and Country-by-Country Reporting (CbCR) across all operating jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TP Policy Design &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Assisting in designing, implementing, and updating intercompany pricing policies to support business growth, new product launches, and international expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intercompany Agreements &amp;amp; Operational TP:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborating with Legal, Finance, and Treasury to ensure intercompany agreements match economic realities and operational transfer pricing calculations/adjustments are executed accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Partnering closely with the International Tax Manager and International Tax &amp;amp; Transfer Pricing Lead on key group projects, European expansion initiatives, and cross-border structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Defense:&lt;/strong&gt; Serving as a key point of contact for tax authority enquiries and audits relating to transfer pricing matters globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Providing clear, pragmatic transfer pricing advice to internal stakeholders across Business, Finance, and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a professional qualification: Qualified accountant (ACA/ACCA) and/or tax advisor (CTA/ADIT or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong technical background in transfer pricing. Candidates making their first move directly from professional practice (Big 4 / Top 10 / specialist TP firms) are strongly encouraged to apply, as are those with existing in-house experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Proactive, have a hands-on mindset with the ability to operate autonomously and translate complex transfer pricing concepts for non-tax stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
